<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-day t-bill yield up, 91-, 182-day down.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day t-bill yield up, 91-, 182-day down.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills rose to 23.89 percent on Saturday from 21.20 percent at the previous auction on December 31, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 32.05 percent from 38.22 percent.</p>
<p>182-day T-bill yields fell to 35.11 percent from 38.48 percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>					  Jan 4	     Dec 31</p>
<p>    Issue volume		    6.00 mln lei    5.00 mln lei</p>
<p>    Denominations		   1,000 lei	 1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand		  9.41 mln	  8.99 mln</p>
<p>    Volume sold		     6.00 mln	  5.00 mln</p>
<p>    Yield			     23.89 pct	 21.20 pct</p>
<p>    Price			     98.2 pct	  98.4 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids		   98.2-98.7 pct   98.4-98.5 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity			  Feb 6, 1997     Jan 30, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>					  Jan 4	     Dec 31</p>
<p>    Issue volume		    16.00 mln lei   14.00 mln lei</p>
<p>    Denominations		   1,000 lei	 1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand		  22.11 mln	 23.86 mln</p>
<p>    Volume sold		     16.00 mln	 12.00 mln</p>
<p>    Yield			     32.05 pct	 38.22 pct</p>
<p>    Price			     92.6 pct	  91.3 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids		   92.6-94.2 pct   91.3-95.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity			  April 10, 1997  April 3, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month paper auction:</p>
<p>					  Jan 4	     Dec 31</p>
<p>    Issue volume		    3.00 mln lei    6.00 mln lei</p>
<p>    Denominations		   1,000 lei	 1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand		  3.29 mln	  5.82 mln</p>
<p>    Volume sold		     3.00 mln	  5.80 mln</p>
<p>    Yield			     35.11 pct	 38.48 pct</p>
<p>    Price			     85.1 pct	  83.9 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids		   85.1-88.0 pct   83.9-87.8 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity			  July 10, 1997   July 3, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
